	(text "Every part on this sheet that touches LIVE and SELV is a declared isolator: VIOSM >= 8 kV, VISO >= 5 kVrms,\nVIOWM >= 1414 V DC, CLR/CPG 8 mm. 8 mm < 10 mm (PD2 creepage) -> conformal coating PD1 over the B1 zone\nis MANDATORY; routed slot under every isolator; SELV copper >= 10 mm from LIVE copper elsewhere."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
